    "description": "### Impact\nPrevent iframe allowlist bypass by treating literal backslashes as path separators in the iframe src traversal guard. The sanitizer now rejects decoded dot segments followed by a backslash, closing a gap where browser URL normalization could move an allowlisted URL outside its intended subpath.\n\n### Patches\nUpgrade to the patched version.\n\n### Workarounds\nUpgrade to the patched version.",
